\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces (A) Mean seepage rate $S$ computed for each closure, with error bars indicating bootstrapped confidence intervals on the mean. (B) Integrated hydraulic conductance $C_L$ determined through regression of $S$ on $\Delta h$ for each closure event. (C) Ratio of seepage to river discharge, $S/Q_r$. Only closure events with at least 5 days of data are included. }}{12}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:summary}{{6}{12}{(A) Mean seepage rate $S$ computed for each closure, with error bars indicating bootstrapped confidence intervals on the mean. (B) Integrated hydraulic conductance $C_L$ determined through regression of $S$ on $\Delta h$ for each closure event. (C) Ratio of seepage to river discharge, $S/Q_r$. Only closure events with at least 5 days of data are included}{figure.6}{}}
